cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite website release 1.53, the repository commit used and the
  exact dataset paths, SHA-256 values and source IDs used in your analysis.
  The historical tag v1.0.0 contains the earlier website release 1.29.
type: dataset
title: "Young CRC: open case data for research agents"
authors:
  - family-names: Young
    given-names: Alexander
version: "website-1.53"
date-released: 2026-10-29
url: "https://youngcrc.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AlexTISYoung/youngcrc"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Patient-led, source-linked clinical and molecular research data for
  Alexander Young's early onset metastatic rectal cancer case, with
  provenance, availability catalogues and agent access tools. Curated
  factual data and new explanatory text use CC BY 4.0; code uses MIT;
  third-party materials retain their own rights. This is a selective,
  incomplete research record, not individualized treatment advice.
keywords:
  - colorectal cancer
  - patient-led research
  - clinical provenance
  - open data
  - research agents
